<title>FRANCE: AIR FRANCE TO MAINTAIN VIRGIN AIRBUS PLANES.</title>
<headline>AIR FRANCE TO MAINTAIN VIRGIN AIRBUS PLANES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France Industries said it had obtained a five year contract for the maintenance of the fleet of Airbus A340 craft bought by Virgin Atlantic.</p>
<p>The contract respresents a turnover of 500 million francs, it added.</p>
<p>Virgin has eight Airbus planes.</p>
</text>
